            },
            "body": "Hi @mickqian, fourth PR in the streaming-residue series (#41909/#41914/#41962): PythonicDetector, InklingDetector, Gemma4Detector and PoolsideV1Detector hold text in _buffer while waiting for the closing marker, and the base finish() silently drops it at end of stream. Each now gets a finish() override flushing the buffer as normal text, with offline unit tests (12 tests, passing locally, ruff clean). CI is blocked by pr-gate needing the run-ci label — could you add it and take a look? Happy to adjust.",
